---
description: Do not run Gradle unless the user explicitly asks
alwaysApply: true
---

# Gradle commands

- Do **not** run `./gradlew`, `gradlew`, `gradle`, or any Gradle wrapper / Gradle CLI command on your own to verify builds, compile, test, or as part of routine work.
- Only run Gradle when the user **explicitly** asks in that conversation (for example: run the build, compile, execute tests, or “run gradle …”).

This applies in every chat and context window unless the user overrides it in their message.
